## Why This Is Asked

This question evaluates your ability to design a comprehensive performance test strategy for AI inference systems operating under multi-tenant workloads with GPU autoscaling and production rollout risks.

## Key Concepts

- Multi-tenant isolation and quota enforcement
- GPU memory pressure handling and dynamic batch sizing
- Backpressure and queueing behavior under burst loads
- Rollback and feature-flag safety mechanisms during rollouts

